Subject: sunshine-cgnat-pair
Why: Loopback/CGNAT may call pin/displays/sessions/apps/close without Basic Auth; RFC1918 still needs credentials.
Depends-on: vendor/PINS sunshine; apply before sunshine-displays.patch

